{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00110",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.35,
      "end_seconds": 5.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Sorry, doctor, I couldn't find the door at first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.06,
      "end_seconds": 11.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "No trouble at all, come in. What's been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.98,
      "end_seconds": 19.01,
      "duration_seconds": 7.03,
      "text": "Mainly pain in both knees. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.6,
      "end_seconds": 22.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "So, how long have you had it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.29,
      "end_seconds": 27.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "It's, It's been going on for six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.0,
      "end_seconds": 38.62,
      "duration_seconds": 10.62,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse. I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.03,
      "end_seconds": 47.76,
      "duration_seconds": 7.73,
      "text": "A hot pack helps a bit. It's every other day. Pretty moderate, if I'm being honest. Squatting definitely sets it off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.54,
      "end_seconds": 53.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any locking of the knee or pain in other joints?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.63,
      "end_seconds": 59.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "No, no locking of the knee or pain in other joints."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.43,
      "end_seconds": 62.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.32,
      "end_seconds": 67.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "It's paracetamol, 650 milligrams, when needed for the knee pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.23,
      "end_seconds": 71.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.93,
      "end_seconds": 76.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Well, yes, eggs. I get a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.56,
      "end_seconds": 77.55,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.22,
      "end_seconds": 80.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.82,
      "end_seconds": 88.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Sorry, I'm just writing a few notes, bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.16,
      "end_seconds": 91.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.97,
      "end_seconds": 98.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.46,
      "end_seconds": 102.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "I've got arthritis in my knees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.62,
      "end_seconds": 103.32,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.01,
      "end_seconds": 107.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Hold on, the screen's frozen for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.27,
      "end_seconds": 124.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Alright, back to you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.25,
      "end_seconds": 127.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.18,
      "end_seconds": 128.93,
      "duration_seconds": 0.75,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.53,
      "end_seconds": 137.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Okay, here we go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.81,
      "end_seconds": 143.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.55,
      "end_seconds": 145.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Okay, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.76,
      "end_seconds": 150.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Now bend it for me, slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.73,
      "end_seconds": 164.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.25,
      "text": "There's mild swelling on the right knee, and a grating feel when I bend it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.46,
      "end_seconds": 168.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Hold your arm out like this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.21,
      "end_seconds": 188.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Bending is limited to about a right angle, and it hurts at the end."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.55,
      "end_seconds": 214.6,
      "duration_seconds": 24.05,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. From what you've told me and what I found, I think we're dealing with osteoarthritis of the knees at this stage. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.92,
      "end_seconds": 218.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Should I be worried about this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.85,
      "end_seconds": 236.14,
      "duration_seconds": 16.29,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like osteoarthritis of the knees, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had pain in both knees for six months, moderate, and no locking of the knee or pain in other joints."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.95,
      "end_seconds": 238.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.69,
      "end_seconds": 243.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.51,
      "end_seconds": 246.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "I hadn't even noticed, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.25,
      "end_seconds": 267.93,
      "duration_seconds": 20.68,
      "text": "I'm going to order an X-ray of both knees, for knee pain. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. I'd like you to take etoricoxib, 60 milligrams, once a day, for five days. You take it by mouth. It's for knee pain. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.27,
      "end_seconds": 296.65,
      "duration_seconds": 27.38,
      "text": "Losing even a few kilos takes a lot of load off the knees, and I'd like you to do the strengthening exercises. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. I'd like you to see physiotherapy as well, and I'll write the referral. Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.02,
      "end_seconds": 306.16,
      "duration_seconds": 8.14,
      "text": "Please come and see me in six weeks. Let me check that I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.54,
      "end_seconds": 314.93,
      "duration_seconds": 7.39,
      "text": "So, I take the etoricoxib, 60 milligrams, once a day and come back in six weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.82,
      "end_seconds": 321.51,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "Right, yes, exactly right. Right, that's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.06,
      "end_seconds": 324.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Nothing more from me, doctor, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.51,
      "end_seconds": 328.21,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}